From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] appxdeploymentclient: IPackageManager3, the package volume (6016)

PackageManager answers QueryInterface for IPackageManager3 (Dropbox asks
for it and uses the result unchecked: it crashed at every start). One
volume, the system drive with %ProgramFiles%\WindowsApps as its package
store: GetDefaultPackageVolume, FindPackageVolumes, FindPackageVolumeByName,
the PackageVolume properties, AddPackageToVolume/StagePackageToVolume/
RegisterPackageWithAppDataVolume onto it, MovePackageToVolume (nothing to
move), StageUserDataWithOptions, package status, and the volume changes
that do not apply to the system volume refused (APPX-PM3).
---
